 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — still on my mind. I keep coming back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"The stores won't stretch past tomorrow, and I'm not choosing who eats. I know the south slope below the meadow — come with me and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "There is no playable joint foraging outing yet. Giving food does not perform the promised outing."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"No, yeah, of course. Forget I asked.\" They won't forget. They'll just stop asking."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Go. But sit with what I said.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Okay. I'll manage on my own.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Another pass over the same ground. Somebody's being careful. Careful people leave cleaner trails — and cleaner trails are still trails."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "You don't answer. The quiet turns pointed."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Something shutters in their face. Tread carefully."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about that favor — we got cut off, 4 days back. 'Go. But sit with what I said.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"It's already handled. Thank you for asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "The ledger in your head doesn't balance: the favors went out, but nobody's living richer. Either nobody was bought — or the price was paid somewhere you can't see."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Still on that favor.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You show them Spicebush — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Kwame owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Never mind the pantry run — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. I hate to ask this, but I can't shake it. I'm achy and wrung out, barely keeping food down. I need help. Please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"I'm burning up and there's nothing left in me. Someone who knows sickness — please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"I wasn't a park ranger. I was a hunting guide. I keep my head down. Old habit. It kept me alive before; it keeps me alive now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about that favor — we wandered off it, 7 days back. 'Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet.' We still owe what's been happening a proper ending, too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"It's already handled. Thank you for asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"As I said — Still on that favor.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"You look handy. What did you do with your hands, before?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Useful. Everything useful matters now. I mean that as a compliment.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You show them White Oak Acorns — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Duel. They just... took Liam. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Same as always: we endure.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "I'd walk through anything to get to them. That's not courage. That's just... math."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "Ramiro has been stockpiling where nobody looks. \"Take half. You've got the hands for it.\" (+4 wood, +4 fiber to the village stash.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I keep something of theirs. Small. I don't show it to people. It's mine.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I keep them in my head like a photograph. Smiling. It has to be enough for now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Still on what they want. — or so they tell me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. They're really talking to you now."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Have you — sorry. I keep thinking about them. I really mean that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"That again?\" Ashanti sighs. \"I confessed that already. I'm not confessing it twice for dramatic effect.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...I should say, I trade in what I know. My knowledge for yours. Or food, if you're short on secrets.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Nikolai is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Nikolai said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Nikolai. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You show them Spicebush — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"What's this about? I don't know what to do with my hands today.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I got lost in it for a second. What did you want to ask? Anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Nikolai owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I count portions out loud before eating. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"We bury, we grieve, we keep going. There's no step four.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  }
 ],
