  "recoverHome": [
   "d12: That night, they bring Kwame home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
  "vouch": [],
  "systemVoice": [
   "d11: SYSTEM: \"Perimeter violated! This is unprecedented! ...Is this unprecedented? Checking. Yes. Unprecedented.\"",
   "d11: SYSTEM: \"INTRUDER REPELLED. The pantry’s aroma is now classified as a defensive liability. The audience is chanting the defenders’ names. Fan clubs are forming. This is how it starts.\"",
   "d11: ◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"The audience wants an encore. A trial, then — smaller this time, but televised.\" Haul 1,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson.",
   "d11: ◈ ARC III — ENGINES. SYSTEM: \"VIEWERSHIP MILESTONE. Organic unit demonstrates compounding capability. Resonance protocols unlocked.\" — Your gifts deepen. Used in sequence, they resonate. The village is no longer just surviving. It is becoming something.",
   "d11: SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."
  ],
  "burialWindowSay": [
   "d12: That night, they bring Kwame home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours.",
   "d14: You say a few words for Kwame. Not a ceremony — just: you were here, and someone noticed you leaving. (-3 trauma)",
   "d14: You bury Kwame. A marker, of sorts. The village will know where. (+4 trauma)",
   "d14: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+6 integration)",
   "d14: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+5 integration)"
  ],
